# Ports that run in the dArkOS compatibility mode (archr-compat-debian) on
# their own: a glob on the script's file name per line, case ignored.
# Add one when a report shows it needs Debian (apt-get, a Debian library
# name, glibc 2.41) and the runtime makes it start. runemu.sh also marks a
# port by itself after such a failure, and system.cfg decides above both:
#   ports["Name.sh"].compat=debian | native     one port
#   ports.compat=off                            never
